# MyGoTo project rule

When working in this project:

1. Read `OBJECTIVES.md` first and follow it.
2. Treat `index.html` `entries` array as the single source of truth for catalog items.
3. Preserve categories exactly: `skill`, `tool`, `ui-kit`, `guideline`, `platform`, `security`, `automation`.
4. For every added entry, include plain-English:
   - what it is,
   - use for,
   - skip when.
5. Prefer canonical repo/docs URLs.
6. If only a short/share link is available, still add the entry and set `sourceNote` to verify destination.
7. Keep the app static and lightweight: no framework or build step unless explicitly requested.
